{"id":"NFSC220","title":"Diet: Is it a cause or a solution","department":"Nutrition and Food Science","level":"Undergrad","credits":"3","description":"If diet is such a straightforward topic, then why and how does this simple matter result in complicated health problems? This course delves deeply into a Big Question at the intersection of diet and health. Diet is a topic that most people know but few people understand. In addition, diet has become one of the most important lenses for looking at a variety of social, economic, and cultural issues. Since the concept of diet is a continuum and has multifaceted aspects, we need to understand it from broad and multidisciplinary perspectives including social, cultural, and economic aspects.","gradingMethods":null,"noLongerOffered":false,"removedTerm":null,"removedDetected":null,"terms":[{"term":"201908","sections":1,"seats":30,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Monica Whent"],"removed":false},{"term":"202008","sections":1,"seats":36,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Monica Whent"],"removed":false},{"term":"202101","sections":1,"seats":60,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":4,"instructors":["Hee-Jung Song"],"removed":false},{"term":"202108","sections":1,"seats":36,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Kathleen Pellechia"],"removed":false},{"term":"202201","sections":1,"seats":60,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Hee-Jung Song"],"removed":false},{"term":"202208","sections":1,"seats":60,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Kathleen Pellechia"],"removed":false},{"term":"202301","sections":1,"seats":60,"openSeats":1,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Hee-Jung Song"],"removed":false},{"term":"202308","sections":1,"seats":60,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Kathleen Pellechia"],"removed":false},{"term":"202401","sections":1,"seats":60,"openSeats":2,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Hee-Jung Song"],"removed":false},{"term":"202408","sections":1,"seats":60,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Amy Scha